flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase Mac mini AI Command Deck architecture
  accDescr: Authenticated browser requests pass through Cloudflare Access and the Moonbase Airlock session guard to reach the Mac mini Node service. The Mac Mirror controller captures GitHub Copilot, Claude Desktop, and the full Mac mini display; the Photo Frame service streams slides from local or uploaded folders; and the Live Session Watcher tails local JSONL logs to drive downstairs mini dinosaur workers.
  Browser["Remote Browser: 3D Command Deck + HUD"]
  Auth["Cloudflare Access + Moonbase Session Guard"]
  Server["Mac mini Node Service (127.0.0.1:47831)"]
  MirrorAPI["MacMirrorController (/api/mac-mirror)"]
  PhotoAPI["PhotoFrameService (/api/photo-frame)"]
  SessionAPI["LiveSessionWatcher (/api/live-sessions)"]
  HostApps["Mac mini: Copilot.app, Claude.app, Display & Photos"]
  HostLogs["Mac mini: ~/.copilot & ~/.claude JSONL Streams"]
  Upstairs["Upstairs Loft: 1st-Person Paws, Dual Monitors & Wall Mirror"]
  Downstairs["Downstairs Floor: Mini Dinosaur Workers (Desks 0..5)"]

  Browser --> Auth
  Auth --> Server
  Server --> MirrorAPI
  Server --> PhotoAPI
  Server --> SessionAPI
  MirrorAPI <-->|"CGWindow + input"| HostApps
  PhotoAPI -->|"Validated slides"| HostApps
  SessionAPI -->|"64 KB JSONL tail"| HostLogs
  HostApps --> Upstairs
  HostLogs --> Downstairs
  Upstairs --> Browser
  Downstairs --> Browser
